{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-23", "prepared_on": "2026-08-23", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-23</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Inherent's AI 'teammate' Faraday outperforms Anthropic and OpenAI at replicating research<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Inherent AI「隊友」Faraday在複製研究上超越Anthropic與OpenAI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">British AI lab Inherent, founded by DeepMind alumni, released Faraday, an AI agent capable of replicating scientific papers, positioning it as a potential stepping stone for scientific innovation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">由DeepMind前員工創立的英國AI實驗室Inherent推出AI代理Faraday，其複製科學論文的能力可能成為推動科學創新的重要墊腳石。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/22/inherent-founded-by-deepmind-alumni-says-its-ai-teammate-just-outperformed-anthropic-and-openai-at-replicating-research/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Frontier AI labs still won't say how they'd contain a rogue model<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">頂尖AI實驗室仍未說明如何遏制失控模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new study finds leading AI labs have few publicly documented plans for containing rogue models, raising concerns about preparedness as AI systems show increasingly unexpected behavior.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一份新研究發現，主要AI實驗室鮮少公開說明如何遏制失控模型，隨著AI系統出現越來越多非預期行為，外界對其應變能力感到擔憂。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/22/frontier-ai-labs-still-wont-say-how-theyd-contain-a-rogue-model/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI urges California to strengthen its AI safety bill<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI呼籲加州強化AI安全法案</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI is now calling for California to strengthen SB 53, the AI safety bill the company had previously opposed.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI轉而呼籲加州強化先前曾反對的AI安全法案SB 53。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/22/openai-says-california-should-strengthen-its-ai-safety-bill/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Harvard's $699 startup bootcamp offers AI avatars of its instructors<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">哈佛699美元創業訓練營推出講師AI分身</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Harvard Business School's Foundry program uses AI avatars to give feedback during practice pitches and mock board meetings.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">哈佛商學院Foundry計畫透過AI分身，在模擬提案與董事會會議中提供即時回饋。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/22/harvards-699-startup-bootcamp-offers-ai-avatars-of-its-instructors/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Cursor reveals Origin's Git backbone built on S3 write-ahead logs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Cursor公開Origin底層Git架構，以S3預寫日誌應對AI代理海量儲存庫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor detailed Continuity, the storage system behind its Origin code-hosting service, which uses S3-compatible write-ahead logs to handle both massive enterprise monorepos and the flood of small repos created by AI agents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Cursor公開程式碼託管服務Origin的底層系統Continuity，採用S3相容預寫日誌，因應企業大型單一儲存庫與AI代理大量建立的小型儲存庫。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178333\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Over 1 million people have clicked LinkedIn's \"AI slop\" button<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">LinkedIn「AI濫文」按鈕已被點擊超過100萬次</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">LinkedIn's chief product officer says more than a million users have clicked the \"Seems like AI slop\" flagging button introduced on July 30th.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">LinkedIn首席產品長表示，自7月30日推出「疑似AI濫文」標記按鈕以來，已有超過100萬人點擊使用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/983502/linkedin-ai-slop-button-one-million-people-message\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Cisco patches near-perfect-score critical flaws in Crosswork platform<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">思科修補Crosswork網路自動化平臺滿分重大漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Cisco released security updates for its Crosswork network automation platform, fixing four critical vulnerabilities, one scoring a near-perfect 9.9 and three others a maximum CVSS score of 10.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">思科發布Crosswork網路自動化與協同管理平臺的資安更新，修補四項重大漏洞，其中一項CVSS評分達9.9，另外三項更達滿分10分。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178334\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Zimbra remote code execution flaw actively exploited<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Zimbra遠端程式碼執行漏洞遭到利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Poland's CERT warns that a known Zimbra mail server vulnerability, CVE-2026-73570, is being actively exploited in ongoing attacks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">波蘭CERT警告，郵件伺服器系統Zimbra已知漏洞CVE-2026-73570正遭到攻擊者持續利用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/178329\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Starcloud raises $250 million for orbital data centers as launch capacity tightens<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Starcloud募得2.5億美元投入軌道資料中心，因發射產能吃緊</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Starcloud secured $250 million to build data centers in orbit, as competition for limited rocket launch slots intensifies.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Starcloud募得2.5億美元資金，計畫建造軌道資料中心，因火箭發射機會日益稀缺，相關競爭正加劇。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/21/starcloud-raises-200-million-for-orbital-data-centers-as-launch-options-dry-up/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> When AI designs a drug, who gets the credit?<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">當AI設計出新藥，功勞該歸給誰？</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">As biotech firms like Insilico Medicine credit generative AI platforms with \"discovering\" promising drug candidates, questions are growing over how much credit AI deserves versus human scientists.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">隨著Insilico Medicine等生技公司宣稱其生成式AI平台「發現」了具潛力的候選藥物，各界對AI與人類科學家之間的功勞歸屬展開討論。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/08/21/1142627/when-ai-designs-a-drug-who-gets-the-credit/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}